' Choosing a weapon by hand, extended rules (run with `seed 1`). Choose the
' knife with a right click in room 2 at Nob Hill. The mutant: the knife is
' kept — v0.9.1's UseBestEquipment keeps the choice when nothing better that
' uses no ammunition is in the pack. Back in the room the frame is still on
' the knife. Saved. (The protective overall taken here is a construction
' material, `protection_parts`, and a right click rightly does not choose it.)
mapclick 19,292          ' sets out
mapclick 19,292          ' walk in
mapclick 253,201         ' the door of room 2
mapclick 253,201
uiclick 256,128          ' take the overall into slot 4
rsceneclick 124,119      ' choose the knife (slot 2)
rsceneclick 88,156       ' the overall: not selectable, nothing happens
esc
fight
mapclick 355,171         ' the mutant
hit
mapclick 253,201         ' back into room 2
mapclick 253,201
save
